      "meta_data": {}
    },
    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME would like to applaud Gaumard Scientific for their generous donation of three units of the Obstetric Mixed Reality Microsoft Hololens 2 technology to enhance obstetric emergency training. This cutting-edge methodology will complement the Victoria birthing simulators owned by AKU, further advancing simulation-based education at CIME. As we accept this donation under the Professor Charles Docherty Memorial Fund, we honour his dedication to advancing healthcare education and look forward to continuing his legacy through innovative technologies and initiatives.",
